                    [
                        "rdfs:comment",
                        "Bus Message Authentication involves hashing the\nbus message contents, the ID of the sender, and a\n\"freshness\" value such as a monotonically increasing\ncounter. The freshness value is what prevents replay\nattacks, as the bus controller/monitor should reject any\nframes with an invalid freshness."
